.TH tucut n 0.1 tclutils
.SH tclutils::tucut
.PP
\fB tclutils::tucut \fR provides small cut\-like helpers for simple delimited text. It is not a full CSV parser. For quoted CSV data use a CSV package.
.SS Load
.CS
package require tclutils::tucut
.CE
.SS Examples
.CS
::tclutils::tucut::field "a;b;c" ";" 2
# -> b

::tclutils::tucut::fields "a;b;c;d" ";" {1 3}
# -> a;c

::tclutils::tucut::text $text -delimiter ";" -fields {1 3}

::tclutils::tucut::file kunden.csv -delimiter ";" -fields {1 3 5}
.CE
.PP
Field numbers are 1\-based. Simple ranges like \fB2\-4\fR are supported.
.SS 0.24.0
.PP
Character selection is available through \fBtclutils::tucut::chars\fR and the \fB\-chars\fR option. Supported specs include single positions, closed ranges like \fB2\-4\fR, and open ranges like \fB4\-\fR or \fB\-3\fR. Character positions are 1\-based.
